  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCDMP: Technical reviews and support to MEAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This note allocates DKK 6 million under the regional programme Climate Change, Conflict, Displacement and Irregular Migration in Sahel, 2021-2024 (CCDMP) for technical reviews, a potential extension of Monitoring Evaluation, Accountability and Learning (MEAL), as well as preparation and start-up of a possible new phase of the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
